                    {
                        "sense_id": "37e31e71-6b44-3db7-a270-8db84ed581c6",
                        "entry_id": "6819d7b9-bf99-3a37-978c-43cdad9fcbf1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Supporting, relating to, or characteristic of, the dynasty of the Napoleons."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc77d401-4564-4e5a-b201-d3c876b78695",
                                "sense_id": "37e31e71-6b44-3db7-a270-8db84ed581c6",
                                "text": "The party of the president (the Buonapartists) gradually and steadily gained over all the others; the soldiery and the peasantry were Napoleonist; the church saw this, and threw its weight into the presidential scale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af5e9226-1134-4e60-8ca0-674c6fd7ea1a",
                                "sense_id": "37e31e71-6b44-3db7-a270-8db84ed581c6",
                                "text": "Mr. F ⸺ hints that your people are not very Napoleonist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "032a59ed-6910-4d0c-9c54-f5ac3fff3d93",
                                "sense_id": "37e31e71-6b44-3db7-a270-8db84ed581c6",
                                "text": "The Spanish legend of a golden age of absolute royalty was even more baseless than the Jacobinical or the Napoleonist legend of France."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "97bde4f4-27a6-4cdd-9564-9bd5c55ce5c2",
                                "sense_id": "37e31e71-6b44-3db7-a270-8db84ed581c6",
                                "text": "Hugo is very Napoleonist, as is generally understood."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8b41894-6000-45fb-82ae-08b5460b9ca9",
                                "sense_id": "37e31e71-6b44-3db7-a270-8db84ed581c6",
                                "text": "Only a week ago I was court-martialed for having attacked my officer and school teacher, and my grandfather is Napoleonist."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfa53cd9-9f62-49bf-9639-7629202fee4d",
                                "sense_id": "37e31e71-6b44-3db7-a270-8db84ed581c6",
                                "text": "Fascism was Napoleonist."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
